---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Newsletter from '../components/Newsletter.astro';
---
<Base title="About Kimberley" description="Meet Kimberley, the paper-loving crafter behind Sparkle by Kimberley, and find out why she started sharing free craft tutorials.">
  <section class="page-hero confetti">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="script hi">Hello, I'm Kimberley!</span>
      <h1>The paper lover behind the sparkle</h1>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="container about">
    <img src="/images/site/kimberley.jpg" alt="Kimberley at her craft table holding a paper flower" width="600" height="600" loading="lazy" />
    <div class="prose">
      <p>I've loved paper for as long as I can remember. As a little girl I folded fortune tellers at the kitchen table, and I've never really stopped! These days my craft room is a happy explosion of card, glitter and half-finished projects.</p>
      <p>I started Sparkle by Kimberley because I kept hearing the same thing from friends: "I'd love to try that, but I'm not crafty." Here's my secret: <strong>nobody is born crafty.</strong> You just need simple steps, the right bits and permission to make a mess.</p>
      <h2>What you'll find here</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Free tutorials</strong> with clear photos for every step, whether it's a calm grown-up project or a rainy-day rescue for the kids.</li>
        <li><strong>Free printables</strong> for colouring, templates and classroom activities.</li>
        <li><strong>A little shop</strong> of kits and supplies I've chosen because they work well with my tutorials.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>My crafting promise</h2>
      <p>I'll always keep things simple, honest and joyful. If a tutorial needs a special tool, I'll tell you a cheaper swap. If something's tricky, I'll say so. And I'll always remind you that wonky is wonderful.</p>
      <p>Don't worry if it's not perfect, that's half the fun!</p>
      <p class="sign script">Kimberley x</p>
      <p><a class="btn sparkle-hover" href="/tutorials">Start crafting</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Newsletter />
</Base>
<style>
  .hi { font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--pink-ink); }
  .about { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 360px 1fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: start; padding-bottom: 2rem; }
  @media (max-width: 800px) { .about { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .about img { max-width: 300px; margin: 0 auto; } }
  .about img { border-radius: 50%; border: 4px solid var(--charcoal); box-shadow: 10px 10px 0 var(--turquoise); }
  .sign { font-size: 2rem; color: var(--pink-ink); }
</style>
